  "body": "Two days ago we rolled out `v1.58.1` to production and ever since there's been a substantial CPU increase on the main process doing `fetch_events` background task which I spotted today:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1615\" alt=\"Screenshot 2022-05-18 at 14 58 24\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1026154/169133429-57132818-e2e8-4e73-bf0e-d1cd50df598f.png\">\r\n\r\nThere's also an increased memory usage overall which is what led us to discover this. Unsure what this is doing exactly, any pointers?\r\n\r\nWonder if this is related to #12778 at all?\r\n",
